   </table><p style="text-indent:4.533%;font-size:10pt;margin-top:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:10pt;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">The following table shows the impact of tenant lease expirations through 2035 at the Company&#8217;s 11 shopping centers owned through unconsolidated joint ventures (excluding ground leases and at 100%) as of December 31, 2025, assuming that none of the tenants exercise any of their renewal options:</span></p>
