re-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </span></p><div style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;"><ix:nonNumeric id="F_6aceef76-0e5f-46ea-89d6-19a487d8803d" contextRef="C_fcb8e15b-866a-4833-91bc-554da9f48273" name="sitc:ScheduleOfOperatingLeaseAssetsAndLeaseLiabilitiesTableTextBlock" escape="true"><p style="text-indent:4.533%;font-size:10pt;margin-top:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:10pt;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Operating lease ROU assets and operating lease liabilities are included in the Company&#8217;s consolidated balance sheets as follows (in thousands):</span></p>
